                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>Data (from May 21 onwards) based on Adjust SDK recorded based on user&apos;s device</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Installs: downloaded an app and successfully opens it for the first time</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>  - Organic: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f'>any install of an app that’s not attributed to a specific install source</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f'>- Reinstalls: uninstalled the app and reinstalled it</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f'>- Uninstalls: uninstalled the app forever (uninstall date based on last active session)</run>
