                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6501' id='28' type-v2='text' w='99032' x='484' y='9409'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Data based on Braze user data on global subscription states, including </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>prospect with no account </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>and excluding those who requested for account deletion (hence older periods tend to have lower customer base). Please note that</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e15759'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>1% of the users belong to Global Control Group and still include users in Sunset Policy</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Subscriber: user opted-in (explicitly confirmed they want to receive email) / subscribed (neither unsubscribed nor explicitly opted-in to receive emails; default subscription state when a user profile is created) to email or push</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Non-subscriber: user has explicitly unsubscribed from your emails.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
